          "name": "Get Companies By Location",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get Companies By Location",
            "description": {
              "content": "Get the list of companies based in a location with filters iso_code and state.\n\nParameters:\n    iso_code (string, required): The ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 or alpha-3 code representing the country. This should be a two or three letter code conforming to the ISO 3166-1 standard. Example: \"US\" or \"USA\" for the United States, \"FR\" or \"FRA\" for France, \"IN\" or \"IND\" for India.\n    state (string, optional): The ISO 3166-2 subdivision code representing a state, province, or region within the specified country. This code identifies the subdivision without repeating the country code. Example: \"CA\" for California, \"MH\" for Maharashtra.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "v1",
                "company_groups",
